! w2-handback.md — hand-back, 2026-11-09

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/ux-polish/w2-handback.md` (hand-back, file date 2026-11-09); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/ux-polish/index]].

